    dct:description "Support and opposition relations extracted from news articles archived in Arquivo.pt. The dataset describes news articles in Portuguese and the presented political stances. [Dataset source](https://data.europa.eu/data/datasets/6130e331078190fd0c6c3819?locale=en), [more information about the project (Portuguese)](https://www.politiquices.pt/about)."@en ;
